          "thread": "Token unlock sell pressure",
          "why": "Repeated tranches across July, September, and a $750M multi-chain December batch kept readers tracking when insiders and early backers could exit, sustaining click interest across multiple months."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://aptos.dev/network/blockchain/execution",
          "thread": "L1 throughput race vs Solana and Sui",
          "why": "Setting a 115.4M daily transaction record above both Solana and Sui briefly made Aptos the performance benchmark, drawing readers invested in the L1 speed competition."
