        {
          "source": "https://unchainedcrypto.com/trapdoor-malware-campaign-targets-crypto-developer-environments-with-34-malicious-packages/",
          "thread": "Developer supply-chain attacks",
          "why": "The TrapDoor campaign deploying 34 fake npm, PyPI, and Rust packages to target Aptos, Solana, and Sui developers showed a growing attack surface that readers tracking ecosystem security found alarming."
